<i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="listing-banner">
<div id="default" class="hidden-important banner banner-top" style="background-color: #1c5a7d">
<div class="wrapper">
<div class="sentences">
<span class="img"><img src="https://www.cfgbank.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/offre_transparente_white.svg" alt=""/></span>
<p>Faire de cette page ma page d&rsquo;accueil par défaut.</p>
</div>
