</div>
</div>
<div id="cookies" class="banner banner-top" style="  background-color: #48494b">
<div class="wrapper">
<div class="sentences">
<span class="img"><img src="https://www.cfgbank.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/espace_client_white.svg" alt=""/></span>
